\fs26 \cf3 \cb7 \strokec3 GOATOOLS propagates gene counts up the GO hierarchy (is_a relationships), then runs a two-tailed Fisher's exact test for every GO term against the annotated background population.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs24 \cf8 \cb9 \strokec8 from\cf3 \strokec3  goatools.obo_parser \cf8 \strokec8 import\cf3 \strokec3  GODag\
\cf8 \strokec8 from\cf3 \strokec3  goatools.go_enrichment \cf8 \strokec8 import\cf3 \strokec3  GOEnrichmentStudy\
\
godag = GODag(\cf10 \strokec10 "go-basic.obo"\cf3 \strokec3 )\
goeaobj = GOEnrichmentStudy(\
    population,            \cf4 \strokec4 # 20,253 annotated genes\cf3 \strokec3 \
    gene2go,               \cf4 \strokec4 # gene \uc0\u8594  \{GO terms\} dict\cf3 \strokec3 \
    godag,\
    propagate_counts=\cf11 \strokec11 True\cf3 \strokec3 , \cf4 \strokec4 # propagate up is_a hierarchy\cf3 \strokec3 \
    alpha=\cf11 \strokec11 0.05\cf3 \strokec3 ,\
    methods=[\cf10 \strokec10 "fdr_bh"\cf3 \strokec3 ],    \cf4 \strokec4 # Benjamini-Hochberg\cf3 \strokec3 \
)\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2 \cf2 \cb6 \strokec2 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb8 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0
\cf2 \cb6 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs20 \cf4 \cb7 \strokec4 STEP 05\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f2\fs28 \cf2 \cb7 \strokec2 Apply multiple-testing correction
\fs22 \cf4 \cb1 \strokec4 \
\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\fs26 \cf3 \cb7 \strokec3 Benjamini-Hochberg FDR correction (default) is applied across all tested GO terms (~10,039 per contrast). With study sets of 11\'9615 genes, FDR is conservative. Nominal p < 0.05 is reported as a supplementary threshold.\cb1 \
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f3\fs24 \cf4 \cb9 \strokec4 # Default: FDR-corrected\cf3 \strokec3 \
python go_enrichment_goatools.py \\\
    --gene2go  gene2go.txt \\\
    --obo      go-basic.obo \\\
    --method   fdr_bh --alpha 0.05 \\\
    --outdir   go_results\
\
\cf4 \strokec4 # Alternative: nominal p-value (small study sets)\cf3 \strokec3 \
python go_enrichment_goatools.py \\\
    --gene2go  gene2go.txt \\\
    --obo      go-basic.obo \\\
    --method   none --alpha 0.05 \\\
    --outdir   go_results_nominal\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

\f1\i \cf4 \cb7 \strokec4 FDR correction across ~10,039 terms with n = 11\'9615 study genes is extremely stringent. Nominal results are valid when disclosed transparently in the methods section.\
\pard\pardeftab720\partightenfactor0

